    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "La consulta SQL para contar los pacientes que iniciaron tratamiento con Simvastatina (Concept ID: 1539403) y cumplen con los criterios de observación previa de 180 días y seguimiento posterior de 365 días es la siguiente:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    COUNT(DISTINCT de.person_id)\nFROM\n    `drug_exposure` AS de\nJOIN\n    `observation_period` AS op\n    ON de.person_id = op.person_id\nWHERE\n    de.drug_concept_id IN (1539403)\n    AND op.observation_period_start_date <= DATE_SUB(de.drug_exposure_start_date, INTERVAL 180 DAY)\n    AND op.observation_period_end_date >= DATE_ADD(de.drug_exposure_start_date, INTERVAL 365 DAY)\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnEBjz1rX0s5ZC6_x-cQWMlWgJL5dJlbGhcdPySJrvDFbK-tZWwkeW1Vrg3nTX7ys5za9jC1Z4mzW825R3Z9NlMkD2GYRP569mbe2FF3ZfksnXt-6bcZ8EXHqjjMYSaOQER9CBs-XN5nIKfX8SsyRjOrjQ=="
